$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Di-tert-butyl Malate (7c) To a suspension of malic acid (3.6 g, 29.0
mmol, 1 equiv) in CH2Cl2 (300 mL) at r.t. under argon was added
N,N'-diisopropyl-O-tert-butylisourea (9;5 38.8 g, 193.7 mmol, 6.7 equiv)
and the mixture was stirred for 2 days at r.t. The crude mixture was
concentrated in vacuo and cyclohexane (400 mL) was added, and the
resulting mixture was filtered over Celite®. The filtrate was
concentrated in vacuo and the crude oil was purified by flash
chromatography (cyclohexane- EtOAc, 5:5) to yield ester 7c. Yellow oil,
yield 4.49 g, 63%. [α]D25 -6.4 (c 0.1036, CHCl3). IR (neat): 3488, 2978,
2934, 2925, 1727, 1367, 1147 cm-1. 1H NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3): δ = 4.30 (dd,
J = 4.5, 5.7 Hz, 1 H, CHCO2t-Bu), 2.73 (dd, J = 4.5, 16.2 Hz, 1 H,
CH2CO2t-Bu), 2.64 (dd, J = 5.7, 16.2 Hz, 1 H, CH2CO2t-Bu), 1.49 (s, 9 H,
t-C4H9), 1.46 (s, 9 H, t-C4H9). 13C NMR (75 MHz, CDCl3): δ = 172.7 (s,
CO2t-Bu), 169.7 (s, CO2t- Bu), 82.3 [s, CO2C(CH3)3], 81.1 [s,
CO2C(CH3)3], 67.5 (d, CHOH), 39.9 (t, CH2CO2t-Bu), 28.0 [q, CO2C(CH3)3],
27.9 [q, CO2C(CH3)3].
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Straightforward total synthesis of 2-O-feruloyl-L-malate,
2-O-sinapoyl-L-malate and 2-O-5-hydroxyferuloyl-L-malate
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Allais, Florent; Martinet, Sophie; Ducrot, Paul-Henri
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Synthesis (2009), (21), 3571-3578

